speechtext:
Could anything be said which could more definitely prove the truth of what the Prime Minister has said about the great conversion than what we are witnessing in this committee where we have had one amendment piled on another in order to carry out certain things? I think I can only express my view by paraphrasing what I believe was expressed by Swift:
For larger fleas have smaller fleas Upon their backs to bite 'em;
And these again have other fleas And so ad infinitum.
